OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FApart from a few showers, much
OL,6,Fof England and Wales will be dry with
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Cloudier conditions
OL,8,Ffurther north, with a band of rain
OL,9,Fmoving southwards through the day and
OL,10,Freaching northern England by evening.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud across northern England
OL,14,Fwill continue to sink south overnight.
OL,15,FDry with clear spells elsewhere.
OL,16,FOutbreaks of rain will push into
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland and western Scotland
OL,18,Flater in the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
